  "releaseNotes": "Utf8Builder:\n      - Removed all string and ByteString overloads to keep Core minimal and zero-alloc.\n      - Kept only three span-based primitives: Append with ReadOnlySpan of char, Append with ReadOnlySpan of byte, and Append with unmanaged T.\n      - Core now focuses strictly on the low-level UTF-8 engine with clear semantics.\n      - Improved consistency and performance across UTF-8 formatting operations.",
